Vaccination
in
China
:
Web-Based
Cross-sectional
Study
Background
The
control
of
vaccine
hesitancy
and
the
promotion
of
vaccination
are
key
protective
measures
against
COVID-19
.
Objective
This
study
assesses
the
prevalence
of
vaccine
hesitancy
and
the
vaccination
rate
and
examines
the
association
between
factors
of
the
health
belief
model
(
HBM
)
and
vaccination
.
Methods
A
convenience
sample
of
2531
valid
participants
from
31
provinces
and
autonomous
regions
of
mainland
China
were
enrolled
in
this
online
survey
study
from
January
1
to
24
,
2021
.
Multivariable
logistic
regression
was
used
to
identify
the
associations
of
the
vaccination
rate
and
HBM
factors
with
the
prevalence
of
vaccine
hesitancy
after
other
covariates
were
controlled
.
