Conclusions
It
may
be
possible
to
increase
the
vaccination
rate
by
reducing
vaccine
hesitancy
and
perceived
barriers
to
vaccination
and
by
encouraging
volunteers
to
advocate
for
vaccination
to
their
friends
and
family
members
.
It
is
also
important
to
reduce
vaccine
hesitancy
by
enhancing
self-efficacy
for
vaccination
,
due
to
its
crucial
mediating
function
.
.
